# Response headers for this deployment's host, Cloudflare Pages:
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Hosting is not a Samla concern — translate to your own host's equivalent,
# or drop this file, if you deploy somewhere else. See the root README.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Fonts never change; cache them for a year.
/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
